# Verbs Reference Content

Verb conjugation patterns and the system behind Greek verbs.

## Purpose

Explain the conjugation SYSTEM - learn 3 patterns, conjugate thousands of verbs. Verb vocabulary browsing is at /learn/verbs.

## Key Insight

Greek verb endings show who's doing the action, so you often don't need separate pronouns. Learn three patterns and conjugate thousands of verbs.

---

## Routing (not a tabs/ file)

Verbs is its own route family, not a `tabs/*.tsx` file and not in `VALID_TABS` of `$tab.tsx`. The "Verbs" entry in `REFERENCE_TABS` links to /reference/verbs.

```
/reference/verbs          route.tsx   layout: ReferenceNav (active "verbs"), ReferenceHero, <Outlet />, PracticeCTA
/reference/verbs/         index.tsx   redirects to /reference/verbs/present
/reference/verbs/$band    $band.tsx   NavTabs over VERB_BANDS; unknown band → notFound()
```

| Band id           | Tab label        | Component (components/verbs-section.tsx) |
|-------------------|------------------|------------------------------------------|
| `present`         | Present          | `PresentTenseSection`                    |
| `past`            | Past             | `PastTenseSection`                       |
| `past-continuous` | Continuous past  | `PastContinuousSection`                  |
| `future`          | Future & να      | `FutureNaSection`                        |

